    "text": "The locus of the middle points of the chords of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math> which passes through the origin is",
